            "sid": "1KI 15:27"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "27",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Baasha okhwa Ahiya owe nju eya Isakari, akholela Natabu ekwangwaani mala amwirira e Kibetioni eye ba Filisiti. Abeele Natabu ne Baisiraeli boosi babotookhelesia lukoba lwa Kibetioni khulwibwaakala. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.15.27",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.15.27"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "28",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 15:28"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "28",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nio Baasha amwiira mu mwiiko kukhola khataru, Asa ne ali omwami owa Yuda. Khwako Baasha ela mu bwami bwa Natabu nga omwami owa Isiraeli. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.15.28",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.15.28"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "29",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 15:29"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "29",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "x",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "1KI.14.10"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "1 Bab. 14.10",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " Nga aba busa omwami ari, eera be enju eya Yeroboamu boosi. Mbao akhaba mulala owarama tawe. Kano kekholekha, khuloondekhana ne elomo niyo Wele Omunyali Owa Bioosi aloma khubirira khu mukholi wewe, Ahiya Omushilo. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.15.29",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.15.29"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "30",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 15:30"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "30",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Lino liakholekha sikila Yeroboamu aambia Wele Omunyali Owa Bioosi, Wele owa Isiraeli lirima, khulwe bumayaanu bwewe ne bumayaanu nibwo akhola Isiraeli bakhola.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.15.30",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.15.30"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
