              "text": "33",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Mu mwiiko kukhola khataru kwe khukhwamiia khwo mwami Asa owa Yuda, Baasha okhwa Ahiya arakikha khukhwamiia Isiraeli yoosi khukhwama e Tirisa. Amiia kimiiko kamakhumi kabili na kine. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.15.33",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.15.33"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
